  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;mso-layout-grid-align:none;\r\ntext-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin&quot;&gt;The proposed ground floor rear\r\nextension with a veranda, by reason of its siting in surface water flood zone\r\n3a, in the absence of an adequate Flood Risk Assessment to assess the future\r\nimpacts and provide adequate mitigation measures, would be likely to result in\r\nthe displacement of water onto adjacent land and fail to provide resilience to\r\nflooding, to the detriment of the safety of future occupiers of the application\r\nsite and adjacent sites, contrary to Policies S112 and SI13 of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), and Policies DM9 and\r\nDM10 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan document (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
